            "review_title": "Review at Le Petit Chef - Danang",
            "review_text": "Marc B\nGreater Melbourne, Australia103 contributions\n0\nGreat Family Thing\nJul 2026 • Family\nAside from this being the best meal I have had during our Vietnam trip (non-Vietnamese food), this is we a great experience. I took my 12 year old son to Le Petit Chef and we both had a great time. The graphics are incredible as are the story lines and to mention the food again - also superb. As always, it’s the people that make the difference and we had an incredible host in Miss La Nguyen. She put her heart into the moments and for that we are grateful.\nRead more\nWritten July 15, 2026",
