            "review_title": "Review at Le Petit Chef - Danang",
            "review_text": "S12\nMunich, Germany16 contributions\n0\nBest ‚le petit chef‘ experience out of the five we had\nApr 2026 • Family\nWe had an amazing time - this was our fifth Le Petit chef show and it was by far the best (the others were in Europe).\nNot only was the food outstanding and the presentation very creative and well fitting to the show, but first and foremost our host, La, made the show a 360 amazing experience.\nShe engaged everyone and especially the children really well, and even found a great way to celebrate a special occasion.\n\nHighly recommended and great value!\nRead more\nWritten April 6, 2026",
